{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-commander#card-zh","repo":"qwert702/dsh-commander","commit":"4d54d63e22df56e84d7fd5dc27513ce05654abf9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-commander 是面向 DSH Web 的多会话任务编排插件，可把任意对话设为指挥官，让模型通过 <dsh-dispatch> 块把独立任务交给现有或新建的 worker 会话。插件在会话头部提供指挥官面板，并持续监视任务状态；支持广播派发、任务依赖、延迟执行、失败续跑和 worker 负载队列。worker 完成后，任务状态、摘要、耗时及变更文件等信息会作为回执送回指挥官，方便继续安排后续工作。另提供协作邮箱、worktree 操作和圆桌讨论入口，适合在 DSH Web 中并行拆解与跟进多步骤工作。使用需安装到兼容的 DSH 环境，并保持浏览器界面运行以执行调度。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1292-1343","lib/client.js:1732-1868","lib/client.js:2062-2208","lib/client.js:2438-2523"]}
{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-commander#card-en","repo":"qwert702/dsh-commander","commit":"4d54d63e22df56e84d7fd5dc27513ce05654abf9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-commander turns a DSH Web conversation into a coordinator. The model delegates tasks to worker sessions; tasks can be broadcast, queued, or linked by dependencies. The browser monitors workers and sends status receipts. A header panel tracks progress. Keep the web interface open for scheduling.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1292-1343","lib/client.js:1732-1868","lib/client.js:2062-2208","lib/client.js:2438-2523"]}
