{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-commander#feature-1","repo":"qwert702/dsh-commander","commit":"4d54d63e22df56e84d7fd5dc27513ce05654abf9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-commander 的功能「协议派发」：指挥官回复中的 <dsh-dispatch> 块可指定已有会话、广播目标或省略目标以新建 worker；引擎解析任务后送入目标会话执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:335-362","lib/client.js:2062-2208"]}
{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-commander#feature-2","repo":"qwert702/dsh-commander","commit":"4d54d63e22df56e84d7fd5dc27513ce05654abf9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-commander 的功能「依赖与排队」：派发块可用 tid 和 depends 建立前后依赖；同一 worker 有任务未完成时，新任务进入发送队列，等待空位再投递。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1914-2024","lib/client.js:2209-2276"]}
{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-commander#feature-3","repo":"qwert702/dsh-commander","commit":"4d54d63e22df56e84d7fd5dc27513ce05654abf9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-commander 的功能「状态监视与回执」：浏览器引擎轮询 worker 状态，读取任务基线之后的事件和变更文件；worker 结束后将状态、摘要等内容作为提示送回指挥官会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2438-2523","lib/client.js:3130-3178"]}
{"unit_id":"qwert702__dsh-commander#feature-4","repo":"qwert702/dsh-commander","commit":"4d54d63e22df56e84e7fd5dc27513ce05654abf9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-commander 的功能「协作辅助路由」：host 注册邮箱、git worktree 和 roundtable 路由，浏览器可提交消息、工作区操作或讨论请求，并接收处理结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:834-935","lib/index.js:960-1275"]}
